OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery expansion raises
OL,4,Aparking concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FA major expansion of a GP surgery in
OL,7,FPeterborough could be approved despite
OL,8,Fconcerns over parking.
OL,10,FWerrington Health Care has submitted
OL,11,Fplans for a two-storey extension at its
OL,12,FChurch Street site, including four new
OL,13,Fconsultation rooms and a backup
OL,14,Femergency generator.
OL,16,FThe practice said the development was
OL,17,Fneeded to accommodate growing patient
OL,18,Fdemand following the transfer of
OL,19,Fpatients from the Werrington Health
OL,20,FCentre, which shut in August 2025.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
