OL,3,GNEWSAGP surgery expansion raises
OL,4,Aparking concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe plans have been opposed by the
OL,7,Flocal highway authority, which says the
OL,8,Fdevelopment could worsen an existing
OL,9,Fshortage of parking spaces. Under the
OL,10,Fproposals, on-site parking would be
OL,11,Freduced from 60 spaces to 54.
